# What it does: REPORTING ONLY. Every run prints, per token, how many in-scope paths carry it, so Kam can see what
# of Datasec's naming sits inside folders this seat owns. Nothing is excluded by this file (Kam's ruling
# nas-shared-folders-owner of 2026-09-11, as Wednesday read it in ANSWER-2, corrected 14:00 on 2026-11-27).
